    "B": "If two angles are supplementary to each other, then the two angles are equal.",
    "C": "If there are two angles, then their supplementary angles are equal.",
    "D": "If two angles are supplementary to the same angle, then the two angles are equal."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "D",
